        "en": "Nearly every owner praises the quality of cuts and styling — dogs and cats leave looking clean, trimmed, and beautifully presented. Several reviewers highlight successful de-matting on difficult coats. Even anxious or notoriously difficult animals reportedly receive thorough, careful grooming that earns repeat business."
