      "title": {
        "en": "Calm, gentle handling of nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners of cats and dogs that are typically difficult at groomers report their pets leave calm and happy. Reviewers note that even older, somewhat aggressive cats were handled without issue. The home-based, quieter environment appears to reduce stress compared to busy salon settings."
      }
    },
    {
