      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple owners specifically call out Jackelyn's habit of sending photo updates while she works — a feature they find reassuring, especially on a first visit or when dropping off an anxious pet. Pickup and drop-off logistics are described as smooth and easy to coordinate, making the whole experience feel personal."
      }
    }
